<!-- SECTION 2: OVERVIEW / INTRO + TL;DR -->
<section class="content-section" id="overview-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">LLP Name Change in Gurugram: RUN-LLP, Forms, and Post-Change Compliance</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - LLP Name Change in Gurugram Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>To change an LLP name: reserve new name via RUN-LLP (3 months validity, no renewal), pass partner resolution, file Form LLP-5 with ROC Haryana, receive fresh Certificate of Incorporation, draft supplementary deed on Haryana stamp paper, file Form LLP-3 as linked form. Then update PAN, GST, bank, MSME, contracts. Central Government direction must be complied within 3 months.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Gurugram LLPs change names for rebranding, mergers, or regulatory direction. For a comprehensive overview, see our <a href="/llp-name-change">LLP Name Change</a> national guide.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Step</th><th>Action</th><th>Timeline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1. RUN-LLP</td><td>Reserve new name on MCA (up to 2 names, no DSC)</td><td>1-3 working days</td></tr><tr><td>2. Partner Resolution</td><td>Consent of all designated partners</td><td>1-2 days</td></tr><tr><td>3. Form LLP-5</td><td>Notice of name change filed with ROC Haryana</td><td>5-10 working days</td></tr><tr><td>4. Fresh Certificate</td><td>ROC issues new Certificate of Incorporation</td><td>With Form 5 approval</td></tr><tr><td>5. Supplementary Deed + Form 3</td><td>Amend LLP Agreement on Haryana stamp paper</td><td>Within 30 days</td></tr><tr><td>6. Post-Change Updates</td><td>PAN, GST, bank, MSME, contracts, website</td><td>1-2 weeks</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p</p>
                <p>ROC Haryana at Chandigarh (from 16 Feb 2026) processes Form LLP-5 and issues fresh certificates. Patron manages end-to-end: name search, RUN-LLP, partner resolution, supplementary deed, coordinated Form 5 + Form 3, and all post-change updates.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 3: WHAT IS GSTAT APPEAL FILING -->
<section class="content-section" id="what-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="two-column">
            <div class="column-content">
                <h2 class="section-title">Step-by-Step Name Change Process</h2>
                <div class="content-text what-is-definition">
                    
                    <p><strong>Step 1: Name Search + RUN-LLP</strong> - Search MCA database for name availability. File RUN-LLP (Reserve Unique Name) on MCA V3. Propose up to 2 names. No DSC needed. Approved name valid for 3 months (no renewal).</p><p><strong>Step 2: Partner Resolution</strong> - All designated partners consent to the name change by written resolution.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Form LLP-5</strong> - File notice of name change with ROC Haryana within 30 days of RUN-LLP approval. Attach: partner resolution, RUN-LLP approval.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Fresh Certificate</strong> - ROC issues fresh Certificate of Incorporation with the new name.</p><p><strong>Step 5: Supplementary Deed + Form 3</strong> - Amend LLP Agreement on Haryana stamp paper to reflect new name. File Form LLP-3 as linked form. See <a href="/llp-agreement-change">LLP Agreement Change</a>.</p><p><strong>Step 6: Post-Change Updates</strong> - Update PAN, TAN, GST, bank, MSME, EPFO, ESIC, contracts, letterheads, website.</p>

                </div>
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
                    <p><strong>Key Terms for LLP Name Change in Gurugram:</strong></p>
                    <p><strong>RUN-LLP:</strong> Reserve Unique Name for LLP - MCA online service. Up to 2 names. No DSC. Valid 3 months, no renewal.</p><p><strong>Form LLP-5:</strong> Notice of name change filed with ROC. DSC required. Filed within 30 days of RUN-LLP approval.</p><p><strong>Form LLP-3:</strong> Linked form to update LLP Agreement with new name. Must be filed alongside Form 5.</p><p><strong>Section 19:</strong> LLP Act provision governing voluntary and directed name changes.</p><p><strong>Fresh Certificate:</strong> New Certificate of Incorporation issued by ROC with updated name.</p>

